s[2].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2017年夏季世界大學運動會田徑男子一百公尺決賽，替中華臺北拿下睽違二十六年的世大運田徑金牌。","n":47,"ssz":"..............................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[3].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"終於熬過了這段恢復期，突破困境，在2021年重新回到賽場。他最終順利拿下東京奧運參賽的資格。","n":46,"ssz":"......................1......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小試身手 2","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.排完時間順序後，把這些事件連起來看。哪一個說法最能整理楊俊瀚這幾年的經歷？","n":39,"ssz":"......................1................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"拿下世大運金牌後，一路順利，最後取得奧運資格","n":22,"ssz":".........1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"先拿下金牌，後來遇到失敗與受傷，但仍努力復健、重回賽場","n":27,"ssz":".......................1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一開始就受傷復健，後來才拿下世大運金牌，最後參加亞運比賽","n":28,"ssz":"............................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色 ☑（圖形），文字流無此資訊","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小試身手 3（延伸文本）","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.〈𪹚龍慶元宵〉　彭仁星","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].title","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"〈𪹚龍慶元宵〉","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].author","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"彭仁星","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].marked_time_words[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"元宵節過後","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].marked_time_words[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"元宵節前","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].marked_time_words[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"元宵節前一天","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"元宵節過後，「化龍返天」是活動的尾聲，火化神龍象徵事事圓滿。","n":30,"ssz":".............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"今年元宵節前，我回到苗栗的阿公家，參加𪹚龍慶元宵活動。","n":28,"ssz":"............................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[2].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"元宵夜，我們到公園參加「𪹚龍之夜」，這是活動的高潮。相傳「炸龍」可以納吉招福，越炸越旺，人山人海，歡天喜地，熱鬧得不得了。","n":62,"ssz":"...........................1.............................1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[3].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"元宵節前一天，街上家家戶戶歡喜的「迎龍」，希望迎來新年的好福氣。","n":32,"ssz":"................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"你發現了嗎？\n時間詞不一定都是年份，也可能是「元宵節前、前一天、元宵夜、過後」這類說法。找到時間詞，就比較能看懂事情怎麼發展。","n":63,"ssz":"...........1..................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"你發現了嗎？","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"時間詞不一定都是年份，也可能是「元宵節前、前一天、元宵夜、過後」這類說法。找到時間詞，就比較能看懂事情怎麼發展。","n":56,"ssz":"....1..................................................."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"主角","n":2,"ssz":".1"},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"楊俊瀚","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[1].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"挫折事件","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[1].items[0].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"雅加達亞運","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[1].items[0].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（單選）","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[1].items[0].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"驕傲地奪得